<Section Title="How to Play">
    <SubSection Title="Core Mechanic — Focus">
        <Explanation>
            <p>
                Elarion is a ranged builder/spender. <strong>Focus</strong> is the bar beneath your
                character; builders generate it and spenders consume it. The goal is maximising ability
                uptime across your cooldowns while keeping <SpellLink Spell="Spells.LunarlightMark" /> and
                <SpellLink Spell="Spells.StarfallVolley" /> rolling.
            </p>
        </Explanation>
        <TipBox Variant="TipBoxVariant.Note" Title="Event Horizon (Ultimate)">
            <SpellLink Spell="Spells.EventHorizon" /> lets you cast <SpellLink Spell="Spells.StarfallVolley" />
            more often while granting 30% haste and 50% reduced Focus cost. It is strongest in AoE.
        </TipBox>
    </SubSection>

    <SubSection Title="Single-Target Priority (Highwind Arrow build)">
        <ol>
            <li><SpellLink Spell="Spells.SkystridersGrace" /></li>
            <li><SpellLink Spell="Spells.EventHorizon" /></li>
            <li><SpellLink Spell="Spells.SkystridersSupremacy" /></li>
            <li><SpellLink Spell="Spells.LunarlightMark" /></li>
            <li><SpellLink Spell="Spells.StarfallVolley" /></li>
            <li><SpellLink Spell="Spells.HighwindArrow" /></li>
            <li><SpellLink Spell="Spells.HeartseekerBarrage" /></li>
            <li><SpellLink Spell="Spells.CelestialShot" /> — procs only</li>
            <li><strong>Empowered Multishot</strong></li>
            <li><SpellLink Spell="Spells.FocusedShot" /></li>
        </ol>
    </SubSection>

    <SubSection Title="Single-Target Priority (Heartseeker Barrage build)">
        <ol>
            <li><SpellLink Spell="Spells.SkystridersGrace" /></li>
            <li><SpellLink Spell="Spells.EventHorizon" /></li>
            <li><SpellLink Spell="Spells.SkystridersSupremacy" /></li>
            <li><SpellLink Spell="Spells.LunarlightMark" /></li>
            <li><SpellLink Spell="Spells.StarfallVolley" /></li>
            <li><SpellLink Spell="Spells.HeartseekerBarrage" /></li>
            <li><SpellLink Spell="Spells.CelestialShot" /> — procs only</li>
            <li><strong>Empowered Multishot</strong></li>
            <li><SpellLink Spell="Spells.HighwindArrow" /></li>
            <li><SpellLink Spell="Spells.Multishot" /> — seeking procs</li>
            <li><SpellLink Spell="Spells.CelestialShot" /> — Focus management</li>
            <li><SpellLink Spell="Spells.FocusedShot" /></li>
        </ol>
    </SubSection>

    <SubSection Title="AoE (3+ targets)">
        <Explanation>
            <p>
                Lean into the Heartseeker Barrage build, pairing <SpellLink Spell="Spells.LunarlightMark" />
                with <SpellLink Spell="Spells.HeartseekerBarrage" />. Bring <strong>Empowered Multishot</strong>
                in earlier and place <SpellLink Spell="Spells.Multishot" /> above
                <SpellLink Spell="Spells.HighwindArrow" /> for multi-target.
            </p>
        </Explanation>
    </SubSection>

    <SubSection Title="Cooldowns & Utility">
        <ul>
            <li><SpellLink Spell="Spells.PathfindersResillience" /> — personal defensive cooldown.</li>
            <li><SpellLink Spell="Spells.GrapplingArrow" /> — AoE crowd control with a 65% movement-speed reduction.</li>
        </ul>
    </SubSection>

